{
 "name": "SUB · Listening post · label and alert",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## SUB · Listening post: label and alert (Lesson 5.3)\nCalled by the collectors with items in one shape: source, item_id, link, posted_at, text.\nRemove duplicates against the Mentions sheet (item_id) -> label with the Card 2 schema and 13 local examples -> alert rules in code -> Mentions sheet -> Telegram now for hard-rule items.\nlevel today -> the 18:00 summary. level report -> Monday's report.\nQuestions and leads (intent) also go to the social inbox you build in 5.5.\n\nMentions columns: source, item_id, link, posted_at, text, sentiment, topic, urgent, intent, confidence, level, alerted, handled_by. No phone numbers, no profiles of people.\n\nCredentials: Google Sheets; OpenAI (a small, cheap model is enough); Telegram.\nPlaceholders: YOUR_SHEET_ID, YOUR_MODEL, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.\nAttach your error workflow (3.6) in workflow settings.",
    "height": 460,
    "width": 560
   },
   "id": "1a40ea34-ce8d-4b0d-8238-ddc9027dc16d",
   "name": "Note 1",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -620,
    -360
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {},
   "id": "4d782157-be8f-4513-b63e-fca23c2a23c7",
   "name": "When called by a collector",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "read",
    "documentId": {
     "__rl": true,
     "value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID",
     "mode": "id"
    },
    "sheetName": {
     "__rl": true,
     "value": "Mentions",
     "mode": "name"
    },
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "a28ae731-c717-456a-933d-cb1739d35722",
   "name": "Read Mentions",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
   "typeVersion": 4.5,
   "position": [
    220,
    0
   ],
   "executeOnce": true,
   "alwaysOutputData": true
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "const known = new Set($('Read Mentions').all().map(r => String(r.json.item_id || '')).filter(Boolean));\nconst seen = new Set();\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $('When called by a collector').all()) {\n  const m = item.json;\n  const id = String(m.item_id || '');\n  if (!id || !m.text || known.has(id) || seen.has(id)) continue;\n  seen.add(id);\n  out.push({ json: m });\n}\nreturn out;\n",
    "mode": "runOnceForAllItems"
   },
   "id": "e6d5f266-acb1-4da2-b1b5-b107bfbc99e2",
   "name": "Remove duplicates",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    440,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
    "schemaType": "manual",
    "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"sentiment\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"positive\",\n        \"neutral\",\n        \"negative\",\n        \"mixed\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"topic\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"quality\",\n        \"late delivery\",\n        \"price\",\n        \"refund\",\n        \"food safety\",\n        \"hours\",\n        \"other\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"urgent\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"description\": \"needs a person today\"\n    },\n    \"intent\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"praise\",\n        \"complaint\",\n        \"question\",\n        \"lead\",\n        \"spam\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"confidence\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"minimum\": 0,\n      \"maximum\": 1\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"sentiment\",\n    \"topic\",\n    \"urgent\",\n    \"intent\",\n    \"confidence\"\n  ]\n}",
    "options": {
     "systemPromptTemplate": "You label customer comments about Harvest Lane, a fresh-produce delivery business in Ibadan. Comments may be in Nigerian English, Pidgin, Yoruba, slang or emoji. Return sentiment, topic, urgent (needs a person today), intent and confidence (0 to 1, your honest estimate).\n\nExamples:\n1. \"Una tomatoes fresh well well, I go order again\" -> positive, quality, praise, urgent false\n2. \"Price don cost o\" -> neutral, price, complaint, urgent false (about price, not anger)\n3. \"This bread is sick 🔥\" -> positive, quality, praise, urgent false (sick = amazing)\n4. \"deadly jollof, we go come back\" -> positive, quality, praise, urgent false (deadly = excellent)\n5. \"Great, another 'fresh' delivery of soft tomatoes 🙄\" -> negative, quality, complaint, urgent false (sarcasm)\n6. \"Half the onions were rotten and nobody is picking my calls\" -> negative, quality, complaint, urgent true\n7. \"My son was sick after eating your ugu\" -> negative, food safety, complaint, urgent true\n8. \"What time do you open on Sundays?\" -> neutral, hours, question, urgent false\n9. \"Do you supply restaurants weekly? We need about 20 crates\" -> positive, other, lead, urgent false\n10. \"Delivery late again. Third time this month.\" -> negative, late delivery, complaint, urgent false\n11. \"Veggies dey fresh but the rider was rude\" -> mixed, other, complaint, urgent false\n12. \"I paid since Monday, nothing came. I want my money back\" -> negative, refund, complaint, urgent true\n13. \"Earn N50k daily!!! Click the link in my bio\" -> neutral, other, spam, urgent false"
    }
   },
   "id": "48976232-dfbe-449b-b7df-7b06eb9bc5ec",
   "name": "Label",
   "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.informationExtractor",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    660,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "model": "YOUR_MODEL",
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "000d980e-6251-4340-9f41-fe0a0c39e96b",
   "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
   "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    660,
    216
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "return { ...$('Remove duplicates').item.json, ...$json.output };\n",
    "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
   },
   "id": "6758b207-a047-4921-ac1b-72523adfb291",
   "name": "Combine",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    880,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "const t = $json;\nconst hard = t.topic === 'food safety' || /threat|police|lawyer|sick after/i.test(t.text);\nconst soft = t.sentiment === 'negative' && t.confidence >= 0.8\n          && ['refund','late delivery'].includes(t.topic);\nreturn { ...t, alert: hard || soft, level: hard ? 'now' : soft ? 'today' : 'report' };\n",
    "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
   },
   "id": "80eab0d3-b6d9-48db-a19c-a32e6e47fc0e",
   "name": "Alert rules",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    1100,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "const t = $json;\nreturn { source: t.source, item_id: t.item_id, link: t.link, posted_at: t.posted_at, text: t.text,\n  sentiment: t.sentiment, topic: t.topic, urgent: t.urgent, intent: t.intent, confidence: t.confidence,\n  level: t.level, alerted: 'no', handled_by: '' };\n",
    "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
   },
